diff --git a/CONTRACT.md b/CONTRACT.md
index 46c977f..24027bf 100644
--- a/CONTRACT.md
+++ b/CONTRACT.md
@@ -174,3 +174,13 @@ without reseeding. Order status, inventory settings and reservation facts must
 survive. Check new commands with fresh request IDs afterward. Admission
 and result history remain host-lifetime only; recovery of pending work, durable
 request replay and live schema migration are not required.
+
+## Packing a submitted order
+
+POST /orders/{id}/pack moves Submitted to Packed. POST /orders/{id}/unpack moves
+Packed to Submitted. Either accepts a repeat in its destination state. Ignore the
+request body. Return the current order summary with 200, an empty 404 for a missing
+order, or 409 with code OrderNotPackable or OrderNotUnpackable from Draft or
+Cancelled. Packing only changes status. From Packed, submit and cancel conflict
+with OrderNotDraft and OrderNotCancellable. Fulfillment retains its G2 precedence,
+compensation and completed-request replay. Concurrent commands must match a serial ordering.
